<title>UK: Bomb attack on police patrol in N.Ireland.</title>
<headline>Bomb attack on police patrol in N.Ireland.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb attack was launched on a police patrol in north Belfast late on Thursday, Northern Ireland security sources said.</p>
<p>There were no reports of any injuries, the sources added.</p>
</text>
